  m_text: 'Thank you for downloading the RPG Creation Kit Demo!


    You can view
    the commands in the Settings.


    This Demo features a branching storyline,
    I recommend playing with both factions and not missing secondary quests to have
    a proper overview of what can be done with the RPG Creation Kit.


    Thank
    you again, I hope you will enjoy this demo.'
